{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_hdnk_37_1","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_37","text":"氣厥論篇第三十七","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_37_2","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_37","text":"黃帝問曰：五臟六腑寒熱相移者何？","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_37_3","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_37","text":"岐伯曰：腎移寒於肝，癰腫少氣。","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_37_4","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_37","text":"脾移寒於肝，癰腫筋攣。","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_37_5","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_37","text":"肝移寒於心，狂隔中。","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_37_6","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_37","text":"心移寒於肺，肺消。肺消者飲一溲二，死不治。","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_37_7","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_37","text":"肺移寒於腎，為涌水。涌水者，按腹不堅，水氣客於大腸，疾行則嗚濯濯，如囊裏漿水之病也。","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_37_8","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_37","text":"脾移熱於肝，則為驚衄。","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_37_9","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_37","text":"肝移熱於心，則死。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_37_10","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_37","text":"心移熱於肺，傳為膈消。","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_37_11","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_37","text":"肺移熱於腎，傳為柔痊。","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_37_12","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_37","text":"腎移熱於脾，傳為虛，腸澼，死不可治。","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_37_13","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_37","text":"胞移熱於膀胱，則癃溺血。","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_37_14","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_37","text":"膀胱移熱於小腸，膈腸不便，上為口糜。","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_37_15","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_37","text":"小腸移熱於大腸，為虙瘕，為沉。","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_37_16","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_37","text":"大腸移熱於胃，善食而瘦入，謂之食亦。","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_37_17","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_37","text":"胃移熱於膽，亦曰食亦。","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_37_18","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_37","text":"膽移熱於腦，則辛頞鼻淵。鼻淵者，濁涕不下止也，傳為衄蔑、瞑目。故得之氣厥也。","sortOrder":18}],"overrides":{}}